| s_axi_control | IP_ISR   | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                                      |
| s_axi_control | A_DRAM_1 | 0x10   | 32    | W      | Data signal of A_DRAM            |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | A_DRAM_2 | 0x14   | 32    | W      | Data signal of A_DRAM            |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | B_DRAM_1 | 0x1c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of B_DRAM            |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | B_DRAM_2 | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of B_DRAM            |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | C_DRAM_1 | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of C_DRAM            |                                                                                    |
